OL,3,GNEWSACouncil launch review after flood
OL,4,Abarriers not used during Storm Boelo
OL,5,
OL,6,FRenfrewshire Council will carry out a
OL,7,Ffull review of its flood prevention
OL,8,Farrangements after flood barriers were
OL,9,Fnot used during Storm Boelo.
OL,11,FA report to the local authority
OL,12,Fconfirmed forecasts before the storm
OL,13,F"significantly underestimated tidal
OL,14,Flevels on the River Clyde".
OL,16,FAs a result, no flood warning was
OL,17,Fissued and part of a multi-million
OL,18,Fpound defence scheme was not activated.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
